# ── Session scratch artifacts (never publish) ────────────────────────────────
# Saved page dumps and API responses used to verify production during a session.
# Named patterns kept accumulating one file at a time; these cover the class.
# Blog.Web has no tracked .html of its own — Razor views are .cshtml, static
# assets live under wwwroot — so ignoring the whole pattern is safe.
Blog.Web/*.html
Blog.Web/*.xml
Blog.Web/scratch/
/*.json
!/global.json

